  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-9b30ca9c-42a7-4417-9470-50d0d5035516\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-e0fe3bb4-815c-4658-9bf4-5e97317b8015\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-06d84e82-98c4-4dc0-af9d-45ef5d2d972e\">마케팅 대행 부업이란, 마케팅을 대신 해주고 돈을 받는 부업입니다. 이 부업의 가장 큰 장점은 돈을 먼저 받고 일을 시작할 수 있다는 점이구요. 내가 마케팅을 할 수 있게 되고, 장기 계약을 하면 매달 수입이 될수 있다는 점이죠. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-d7b354e1-acd1-474f-b43f-3a0ef47dc1f9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-bccd622a-e57b-436c-9371-154b5327e78e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-e9d8f6ea-7945-46db-8449-e95ee0b0783a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-ceafa4ce-2dd7-47f7-a171-6be693b7ff9e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-400f83a2-c96e-4a98-925e-9ab4506018ce\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-0ee13a4b-b260-4291-b434-774da65ea198\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-81306092-7a3b-40c9-b8c3-f5f34d0256f6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-50431988-7584-4167-8e19-769e1441ab29\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-c4153d5c-3d1f-41d7-bd43-62c5ac7f9e83\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-566ab034-6a59-402d-b205-6ffa439c76fc\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-87f21526-22f2-4660-92b6-488fca2e5128\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-5e23aba2-3bf1-4107-b016-ed4fbc229b73\">단점도 있습니다. 바로 먼저 사장님한테 &quot;내가 어떻게 마케팅을 해줄지&quot; 설득을 해야한다는거죠. 순서로 보면 이렇습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-table se-l-default\" id=\"SE-14b0ca0c-5131-4583-8d2b-d1af7d43e3c6\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-table se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n                            <div class=\"se-table-container\">\n                                <table class=\"se-table-content\" style=\"border-top:1px solid rgb(210, 210, 210);border-right:none;border-left:1px solid rgb(210, 210, 210);border-bottom:none;border-collapse:separate;\">\n                                    <tbody><tr class=\"se-tr\"><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 24.25%; height: 24.0px; border-top:none;border-right:1px solid rgb(210, 210, 210);border-left:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(210, 210, 210); background-color: #ffcdc0;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"line-height:1.6;\" id=\"SE-083d0bd4-d9b1-4632-8a58-89eb91589b82\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffcdc0;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-174fa729-21f3-4521-a4dd-0f2f15c88206\"><b>사장님에게 영업</b></span></p></div>\n                \n                                    </td><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 24.25%; height: 24.0px; border-top:none;border-right:1px solid rgb(210, 210, 210);border-left:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(210, 210, 210); background-color: #ffffff;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"line-height:1.6;\" id=\"SE-cee56935-1cef-4fa0-8060-34ae691e8985\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-bc973438-d57c-4a54-8e1e-cfe99784398e\">계약전 상담</span></p></div>\n                \n                                    </td><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 24.25%; height: 24.0px; border-top:none;border-right:1px solid rgb(210, 210, 210);border-left:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(210, 210, 210); background-color: #ffffff;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"line-height:1.6;\" id=\"SE-b3d25156-4614-4c25-a447-8f6bcd841df3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-24f1dcb7-8d36-400a-9ac6-381b3c1ba686\">계약</span></p></div>\n                \n                                    </td><td class=\"se-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width: 27.25%; height: 24.0px; border-top:none;border-right:1px solid rgb(210, 210, 210);border-left:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(210, 210, 210); background-color: #ffffff;\">\n                                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"line-height:1.6;\" id=\"SE-bb7cfcbb-38b5-4fdc-a495-996cb782e1e9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-105c2126-be79-47a4-9e51-8af2716e1fa5\">실제 마케팅을 위한 정보받기</span></p></div>\n                \n                                    </td></tr></tbody>\n                                </table>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module='{\"type\":\"v2_table\", \"id\" : \"SE-14b0ca0c-5131-4583-8d2b-d1af7d43e3c6\", \"data\": { \"columnCount\" : \"4\" }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-0ccaecc1-12d0-460a-8549-5f401a98ecb4\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-5e35715f-5476-43e8-9058-62fb5d758cf3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-8fc2ae26-29c8-441c-a98e-2118b3aa9a5f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-0e12aa0e-bf61-415a-a26d-bbd38c8bc826\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-0441f446-a056-4807-89e0-0729269cafbd\">​보통 시작조차 못하는 분들은 첫 단계인 &#x27;사장님에게 영업&#x27; 이 단계를 못 넘어가시더라구요. 이분들을 위해 오늘은 영업할때 드리면 좋을 자료 만드는 법을 알려드릴게요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-812cc3b0-0bd7-49a1-81ff-1af958307500\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-ae3c0027-9737-4997-a443-b73c6ef5e34c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-4fbaf4cc-79df-41b6-96a2-895c9d4406c2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-a7bd4afa-4167-4395-9e07-53b23e01e850\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-73105c75-1bee-4187-944e-edf4d065a42d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-dbea93a2-54b5-4d6e-bfe7-297c9da6bc21\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-7923fa1c-4660-4fb2-8318-632dc691f483\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-8f340dfe-45a9-4169-bb85-1df7f0ea814e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-12061b08-cc92-4f43-8461-a40d57300ed9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-8880f717-2dea-4dda-816f-4240bf6d1bb3\">아래 자료는 꼭 대면으로 만나서 주실필요가 없습니다. 그냥 만들어서 톡톡이나 오픈채팅방에 뿌려도 됩니다. 단, 아무한테나 뿌리지 마시고, 아래 예시를 업로드 한 후 신청을 받아서 만들어 주시면 좋을것 같습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-94e6b6e3-f823-4257-9854-e9f9c4bdf618\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-7c679dd1-b6b5-4f0c-8a35-c91a6ac999f9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-b9503ddb-0636-44bf-a282-18d55517ed6f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-e9422185-5dcd-42ff-9c57-130d4ad98af7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-f8e887f9-33b2-44c4-b1e1-7844cb909f43\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-0521ede1-750b-4a48-81b0-6799f7338a59\">&lt;순서&gt; </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-2b6818f8-f089-4386-ad88-99a3f633da06\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-155f00ad-8553-404c-9a02-e58db93e0610\">1. 예시와 신청서를 오픈채팅방 혹은 톡톡에 올린다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-c931b00f-0a56-47c9-adcb-dfe033330ce8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-c78df549-e0d0-4a17-8e3c-e49d0c39c059\">2. 신청이 온 분에게 아래 양식에 맞춰서 만들어서 보낸다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-6fa15a6a-70cd-47bf-88d7-4c5894b733d5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-9cd8c12e-d8f2-4f60-812f-f6e9f3d5b808\">3. 보고 상담요청이 오면 </span><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b3a79bf5-4319-4656-8894-b3b31ab62fe1\"><a href=\"https://cafe.naver.com/ranschool/26016\" class=\"se-link\" target=\"_blank\">계약 전 상담 예시글(1) </a></span><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-051891a3-ff24-4a9f-b64e-0f245dcecb2f\">처럼 상담후 계약한다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-0574ae7e-298b-4454-b119-0db0103278cb\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-ef24995b-e292-426f-a49a-b15c00810350\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-4b59898e-4886-4339-bef3-b827bbf46a12\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-58ee1b30-134b-4f58-b321-c849f3927465\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-37c5f1b3-88c7-4960-b954-54d631d1d965\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-98bbc070-2f61-48bd-bbf6-3f33d8fdaa41\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-b03576ed-8521-41c7-afcb-4282eb9b7cbd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-80a468d9-dd29-4dcd-bf9e-bbb66288a1a8\">그럼 예시와 신청서를 제가 드린 양식에서 이제 수정해서 하시면 됩니다. 아래 양식에서 꼭 본인 상호명으로 수정하신 후 사용하세요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_bubble\" id=\"SE-ee39a6be-7b93-49f0-89f7-e9e9206ba6c4\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section